      "primarySkill": "lrpc_natural_rate_shift",
      "secondarySkills": [],
      "repairSkill": "lrpc_natural_rate_shift",
      "commonError": "Confusing a change in the natural rate with a movement caused by inflation.",
      "feedback": "The structural shift is 6.4 − 5.6 = 0.8 percentage point. Actual unemployment is temporarily 5.6 − 4.9 = 0.7 point below the new natural rate. Once the demand surprise disappears, the long-run anchor is 5.6, not the old 6.4 or temporary 4.9.",
