      "id": "ERQ-LG-Q-336",
      "q": "In the value-of-money graph, the economy moves from a to b. Velocity may change. A nominal wage rises in the same proportion as the implied price level, with technology and labor supplies unchanged. What is consistent with monetary neutrality?",
