      "graphDescription": "The horizontal axis is real output Y and the vertical axis is the price level. AD1 and AD2 slope downward, with AD2 to the right of AD1. AS1 and AS2 slope upward, with AS1 above/left of AS2. Dashed guides mark Y3, Y1, Y2 and P1, P2, P3. AD1 intersects AS2 at Y1/P1, AD1 intersects AS1 at Y3/P2, AD2 intersects AS2 at Y2/P2, and AD2 intersects AS1 at Y1/P3."
